Walrus DeFi Private Transaction Rewards: 20% Fee Refund, Extra Annual Yield for Secure Staking

Addressing DeFi users' needs for privacy and returns, Walrus DeFi launched the "Private Transaction Yield Package" in 2026: private transaction fees are reduced from 0.3% to 0.2%, with a 20% fee refund (immediately credited in WAL form); users participating in the "Secure Staking Program" (staking over 1000 WAL) receive an additional 5% annual yield reward. According to official data, private transaction users reached 18,000 in Q1 2026, with average monthly savings on fees and rewards exceeding 300 WAL, and thanks to the Seal privacy feature, the fraud protection rate remains at 100%.
