2026 Walrus Annual Revenue Settlement Event Launches! Users who meet the criteria enjoy doubled revenue, and inviting friends brings additional rewards

@WalrusProtocol 5 Monthly launches the "2026 Annual Revenue Settlement Event": From December 2025 to April 2026, users who meet the criteria of "staking ≥1000WAL" or "storing ≥100GB of data" can enjoy doubled revenue for Q2 2026 (up to 10000WAL per user); inviting new users to participate in staking/storage also earns an extra reward of 20% of the new user's first month's revenue (no invitation limit). Official data shows that currently 45,000 users have met the criteria, with expected total revenue distribution in Q2 exceeding 200 million WAL.

